REGEDIT4

; GTA2 fullscreen resolution -> 1920x1080
;
; REGEDIT4, not "Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00" -- Win98's regedit will
; not import the 5.00 format.
;
; These are REG_DWORD.  The game reads them with a 4-byte RegQueryValueExA into
; a DWORD (confirmed at gta2 manager.exe:0x41448a), so a string value silently
; fails.  .reg files have no "decimal:" prefix -- dword: values are ALWAYS hex.
;
;   0x780 = 1920
;   0x438 = 1080
;
; This must match the driver's "Glide Override Resolution" setting.  DMAGlide
; only ever has one patched mode slot, so the game can only open the resolution
; the override names.
;
; NOTE: the game resets these to 640x480 and writes that back if a mode fails to
; initialise (the fallback path at 0x5d2314), so re-check after any bad launch.
;
; To go back: 0x280 (640) and 0x1e0 (480).

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\DMA Design Ltd\GTA2\Screen]
"full_width"=dword:00000780
"full_height"=dword:00000438
